<!--
  Every route `expo export -p web` writes to `dist/`, with the tab routes first.

  No <lastmod>: it must be the date the *content* changed, and this file is a
  static asset copied verbatim into the build — a date typed in here would be
  wrong within a week, and a wrong lastmod is treated as noise by crawlers.
  Frequencies are honest: the dashboard and draw pages change with every draw,
  the reference pages do not.
-->
